    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的真人双人情感片段，真人影像\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical real two-person emotional segment)\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The frames show high visual fidelity with clear details in faces, clothing, and environment.\n- Lighting is well-balanced, with warm indoor illumination contrasting with cooler outdoor light through the doorway, contributing to depth.\n- Rain effects outside are convincingly rendered; rain droplets and streaks are visible.\n- The interior architecture and textures look realistic; no obvious artifacts or distortions.\n- Transitions between shots are smooth; color grading remains consistent.\n- Overall, Visual Quality is strong and aligns with a top-tier production level.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video presents two people in an intimate, emotionally toned moment, matching the intended content.\n- The setting (doorway/entrance with rain) supports the described scenario.\n- The framing is predominantly horizontal rather than the requested vertical 9:16 format, which is a notable deviation from the prompt.\n- Despite the aspect ratio mismatch, the core elements of the prompt are captured, resulting in a solid alignment score.\n\nPhysical Consistency / Common-sense:\n- Movements, gestures, and interactions feel natural and coherent within the scene.\n- Rain behavior, lighting, and spatial relationships follow plausible physics; no obvious inconsistencies.\n- The overall scene maintains believable physical realism.\n\nGround-truth scores:\n- Visual Quality: 4\n- Text-to-Video Alignment: 4\n- Physical Consistency: 4\n\nOverall assessment: The video demonstrates strong technical execution and faithful adherence to the emotional intent, with a minor misalignment due to the aspect ratio not meeting the 9:16 requirement. This keeps all three dimensions at a solid 4 across the board.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
